When you step into the doorway, what message do you get?  Shopkeepers don't
like invisible customers, or people carrying pick-axes.  (They must think
you're going to rob them by digging through their walls, or something...;-)
If you fit either of these, he'll say something about it and refuse to move.

> Manlobbi is standing inside the door. I don't seem to be able to move
> diagonally to either side of him (a problem I've had before going into
> rooms). Help??

Doorways don't allow for diagonal movement.  If you kick a door down (or
otherwise remove it), it counts as an open space, and so you can move
diagonally.  Shopkeepers don't like this sort of thing, though, so I'd
recommend against kicking them down.

